sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant C as Control node
    participant R as Runner
    participant A as Agent
    P->>GH: Assign + schmeide:ready
    GH->>C: issues webhook
    C->>C: Verify, build job
    C->>C: Store job (pending)
    C-->>GH: 202 created
    C->>R: Deliver job
    R->>C: claimed, ask for token
    C->>GH: Mint installation token
    C-->>R: Token for one repo
    R->>GH: Read blocked-by, pick base
    R->>R: Worktree on {issue}_{slug}
    R->>R: Read .schmeide/config.toml
    R->>A: Writer session (issue brief)
    A-->>R: Edits + PR text
    R->>R: Run the gate
    R->>R: Secret scan, push
    R->>GH: Open PR as the App
    loop up to --max-review-rounds
        R->>A: Reviewer session
        A-->>R: Pass or changes
        opt changes + review_fix on
            R->>A: Fix session, gate, push
        end
    end
    alt automate.merge on
        R->>GH: Green checks, then merge
        R->>GH: Comment: merged
    else merge off (default)
        R->>GH: Comment: PR open
    end
    R->>C: Final status
    R->>GH: Revoke token
